Remember these 4 sentences

StorageClass:

"I tell Kubernetes HOW to provide storage."

PVC:

"I REQUEST storage."

PV:

"I represent the ACTUAL storage."

Pod:

"I USE the storage through the PVC."

So the real flow is:

StorageClass
     ↓
   PVC
     ↓
Kubernetes provisions
     ↓
   PV
     ↓
   Pod

StorageClass is not the storage. PVC is the request. PV is the storage.

